    "notes": {
        "f4000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001": {
            "x": 144,
            "y": -256,
            "width": 640,
            "height": 300,
            "content": "## Pipeline stage result\n\nCounterpart of `CI - project status -> pipeline` (Appmixer-ai/appmixer-components#2890). The Testing runner on the OpenClaw host (`.github/openclaw/vero-testing/testing.mjs`) posts its result to this flow's webhook URL, which lives root-only on the host (`/root/.openclaw/pipeline/callback.json`) — the URL is the credential.\n\n`Check the result` validates the payload and picks the next status (Testing: passed → Review, failed → In Progress, blocked → Needs input). The comment is rewritten with the same renderer the dispatcher uses, so neither loses what the other wrote; the card moves only after the comment is written.\n\n**Source of truth:** `.github/appmixer-flows/pipeline-stage-result.json` in the connectors repo."
        }
